{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEP","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"西番雅書","commonName":"西番雅書","title":"西番雅書","order":36,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"831988651ecf9325c83dd1e77b70d29c47c26109148cecfe009029ff5637d6c2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEP/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEP/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":51},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的敗壞"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"這叛逆、污穢、充滿壓迫的城有禍了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她不聽命令，不受管教；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不倚靠耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不親近她的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的首領是咆哮的獅子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的審判官是夜間的豺狼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不留一點獵物到天明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的先知狂妄詭詐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的祭司褻瀆聖殿，違背律法。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但城中的耶和華是公義的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂絕不做不義之事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂每天早晨伸張正義，從不間斷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，不義之人卻不知羞恥。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"「我已消滅列國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毀他們的城樓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們的街道荒廢，沒有路人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的城邑淪為廢墟，杳無人跡，沒有居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我以為這城一定會敬畏我，接受管教，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣我就不必照所定的毀滅她的居所。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，他們卻更加熱衷於犯罪作惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「因此，要等候我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等候我起來指控的日子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已決定召集列國，匯聚列邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向他們傾倒我的烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的怒火必吞噬天下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華的拯救"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"「那時，我必潔淨萬民的口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們好求告我的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"同心合意地事奉我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些敬拜我的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是我那些分散的子民必從古實河對岸帶著供物來獻給我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那天，你必不再因背叛我而羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為那時我必除掉你那裡的狂傲之徒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在我的聖山上必不再高傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必把謙卑貧苦的人留在你那裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必投靠在耶和華的名下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的餘民必不再作惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再撒謊，口中不再出詭詐之言。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們吃喝躺臥，無人驚擾。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["歡樂之歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"少女錫安啊，歌唱吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，歡呼吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女耶路撒冷啊，盡情地歡喜快樂吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華已經撤銷對你的刑罰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"趕走你的仇敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的王耶和華與你同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必不再懼怕災禍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那天，耶路撒冷必聽到這樣的話：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「錫安啊，不要害怕！不要雙手發軟！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的上帝耶和華與你同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是大能的拯救者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必因你而歡喜快樂，歡然歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用祂的愛安慰你。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"「我必招聚你那裡因不能守節期而憂愁的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你不再蒙受羞辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，那時我必懲罰所有欺壓你的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救瘸腿的，召回分散的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們的羞辱化為尊榮，聲名遠揚。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，我必招聚你們，帶你們回到故土。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們親眼目睹我帶你們回到故土後，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使你們在天下萬民中聲名遠揚，得享尊榮。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEP/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAG/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEP/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}